{"unit_id":"xrn1997__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"xrn1997/dsh-session-delete","commit":"e9df976963111e1602a0b329a097c92195d6af5d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xrn1997/dsh-session-delete 是一款面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的会话管理插件。它通过宿主侧栏和会话行菜单接入，提供可恢复删除、批量删除与撤销、回收站详情浏览、会话恢复和显式彻底删除，并可手动检查孤儿会话及附件。删除父会话时会将其子会话作为一组处理；配置通过宿主 patch 提供，回收站数据保存在本机。适合需要整理或恢复 DSH 对话的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:45","src/index.ts:81-84","src/verbs/delete-session.ts:24-34","src/client/delete-menu-item.tsx:28-35"]}
{"unit_id":"xrn1997__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"xrn1997/dsh-session-delete","commit":"e9df976963111e1602a0b329a097c92195d6af5d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xrn1997/dsh-session-delete adds recoverable session deletion to DSH. Users can move chats to trash, undo deletion, restore sessions, or permanently remove them. The sidebar shows trash details; parent sessions move with their children. Manual orphan cleanup is available, and trash data stays local.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:45","src/index.ts:81-84","src/verbs/delete-session.ts:24-34","src/client/delete-menu-item.tsx:28-35"]}
